<title>FRANCE: Morocco seeks 40,000 T optional soft wheat.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks 40,000 T optional soft wheat.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco will hold a tender on January 16 to import 40,000 tonnes of optional-origin soft wheat for delivery between February 5 and February 15, European grain traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
